    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/37b2a1218d908f217843444cc9ce5753.avif?t=1741226822\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dive into the creative world of <strong>World of Mines Creator\u2019s Edition</strong>, where the beloved puzzle mechanics of Minesweeper are elevated through pixel-art innovation. Use our intuitive in-game editor to craft your own stunning pixel artworks, instantly transforming them into playable Minesweeper puzzles. With over 600 community-generated levels and endless new creations shared through the Steam Workshop, every gameplay session offers fresh challenges and inspiration.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/7a52cb27c7ccef3f83c6245de02eeada.poster.avif?t=1741226822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/7a52cb27c7ccef3f83c6245de02eeada.webm?t=1741226822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/7a52cb27c7ccef3f83c6245de02eeada.mp4?t=1741226822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Join an active community of artists and puzzle enthusiasts, share your masterpieces, and challenge yourself with an ever-expanding gallery of creative puzzles. Whether you\u2019re nostalgic for classic Minesweeper or seeking a fresh creative outlet, this is your chance to leave your mark on the game. Experience Minesweeper reimagined, and become part of an endlessly evolving puzzle community today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective of the game is to clear each pixel art of hidden \u201cmines\u201d or bombs without detonation, albeit with help from clues stating the number of neighboring mines for each tile. The player is initially presented with a hidden pixel art. The game is played by marking all tiles under which a mine is hidden with a flag(Right Click) and freeing up all tiles that do not have a mine underneath. If a tile containing a mine is revealed instead of being marked with a flag, the player loses the game. The digit displayed in tiles indicate the number of mines adjacent.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/37b2a1218d908f217843444cc9ce5753.avif?t=1741226822\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dive into the creative world of <strong>World of Mines Creator\u2019s Edition</strong>, where the beloved puzzle mechanics of Minesweeper are elevated through pixel-art innovation. Use our intuitive in-game editor to craft your own stunning pixel artworks, instantly transforming them into playable Minesweeper puzzles. With over 600 community-generated levels and endless new creations shared through the Steam Workshop, every gameplay session offers fresh challenges and inspiration.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/7a52cb27c7ccef3f83c6245de02eeada.poster.avif?t=1741226822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/7a52cb27c7ccef3f83c6245de02eeada.webm?t=1741226822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945560/extras/7a52cb27c7ccef3f83c6245de02eeada.mp4?t=1741226822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Join an active community of artists and puzzle enthusiasts, share your masterpieces, and challenge yourself with an ever-expanding gallery of creative puzzles. Whether you\u2019re nostalgic for classic Minesweeper or seeking a fresh creative outlet, this is your chance to leave your mark on the game. Experience Minesweeper reimagined, and become part of an endlessly evolving puzzle community today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objective of the game is to clear each pixel art of hidden \u201cmines\u201d or bombs without detonation, albeit with help from clues stating the number of neighboring mines for each tile. The player is initially presented with a hidden pixel art. The game is played by marking all tiles under which a mine is hidden with a flag(Right Click) and freeing up all tiles that do not have a mine underneath. If a tile containing a mine is revealed instead of being marked with a flag, the player loses the game. The digit displayed in tiles indicate the number of mines adjacent.</p>",
    "short_description": "Classic Minesweeper meets pixel art creativity! Craft unique pixel puzzles, transform them into challenging minesweeper levels, and explore endless community creations.",
